# .Renviron.example
# Copy this to .Renviron and fill in the values you need. .Renviron is
# gitignored and must never be committed.
#
# The app runs with NONE of these set: it falls back to the sibling checkout at
# ../fwise-data/ and writes submissions to dev/submissions_local.csv.

# ---- Data source -------------------------------------------------------------
# The ONE variable that says where the data comes from. Two modes:
#
#   unset       ../fwise-data/ - the sibling checkout. Local development makes
#               no network calls at all.
#   https://... a raw GitHub base URL, for Posit Connect Cloud, so the client can
#               publish new data by pushing rather than by redeploying.
#
# Point it at the directory holding metadata.json and schema/, NOT at schema/
# itself. A trailing slash is tolerated.
#
# Locally you can leave it unset. Setting it explicitly, as below, means the app
# still finds the data when run from a different working directory.
# FWISE_DATA_SOURCE=/absolute/path/to/fwise-data
# FWISE_DATA_SOURCE=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ORG/fwise-data/main

# ---- Submissions -------------------------------------------------------------
# There is nothing to configure. Submissions append to dev/submissions_local.csv
# and need no credentials.
#
# The Google Sheets backend has been REMOVED - submissions are moving to GitHub.
# The GitHub write path is not built yet; it needs a token that does not exist.
